# Ignore file used ONLY when building .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile (BuildKit looks for
# <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile and prefers it over the repo-root
# .dockerignore). That keeps this build independent of the root file, which is tuned for the
# app image and must not hide .clusterfuzzlite/build.sh from the COPY in this Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/build-*
server/data
